}}'''Soda Knife''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife obtainable from opening the [[2025 Summer Box]] during the [[Summer Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
The blade is decorated with a summery lemonade design. It has slices of lemon, fizzy bubbles, mint leaves, and a can of lemonade, all in shades of yellow, and green. The guard is golden, while the grip is black.
